  "description": "Solve SQLite concurrency errors (SQLITE_BUSY, \"database is locked\", SQLITE_BUSY_SNAPSHOT) in \n            Entity Framework Core with drop-in write serialization. Implements Channel-based queuing, \n            automatic BEGIN IMMEDIATE transaction upgrades, exponential-backoff retry with full jitter, \n            WAL-mode optimization, and 10x faster bulk inserts. Solves multi-writer, multi-reader conflicts \n            without connection pooling complexity. Works with .NET 10 and netstandard 2.0 runtimes. \n            Security: Updated SQLitePCLRaw.core to 2.1.12 (fixes GHSA-2m69-gcr7-jv3q).",
